    <h1>New Business Tech Setup</h1>
    <p style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:26px; color:var(--teal); margin-bottom:24px;">From £300</p>

    <p><strong>Starting a business but not sure where to begin with the tech?</strong></p>
    <p>You've got the business idea, the skills and the motivation. But then come all the decisions about domains, business emails, bookings, forms, payments, customer information and how everything should work together.</p>
    <p>Where do you start? What do you actually need? And how do you avoid paying for five different tools that do practically the same thing?</p>
    <p>That's where I come in.</p>
    <p>I'll help you work out which systems your business needs, get everything set up and make sure it works properly.</p>
    <p>No unnecessary subscriptions, complicated systems or tech for the sake of it.</p>

    <h2>What can I help you set up?</h2>
    <p>Depending on your business, this might include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Choosing, purchasing and connecting your business domain</li>
      <li>Setting up professional business email</li>
      <li>Booking and appointment systems</li>
      <li>Enquiry forms and customer onboarding</li>
      <li>Payment and invoicing tools</li>
      <li>Organising customer information and records</li>
      <li>Connecting tools and creating simple workflows</li>
      <li>Setting up file storage and everyday business processes</li>
      <li>Testing everything and showing you how to use it</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You won't necessarily need all of these. We'll focus on what's right for your business.</p>

    <h2>How we can work together</h2>
    <h3>Done for you</h3>
    <p>You tell me what you need, we agree the setup and I handle the technical work. Once everything is ready, I'll walk you through how it works.</p>
    <h3>Done with you</h3>
    <p>We book dedicated working time and build things together. You can ask questions, make decisions and see how everything works as we go.</p>
    <h3>A mix of both</h3>
    <p>We work out the requirements together, I handle the build and then we review and test everything before handover.</p>

